                        "rating":  4,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Located in the 2nd-floor food court, the food is prepared incredibly quickly. Even on busy weekend lunchtimes, it only takes two minutes to make a meal. The rice, curry, omelet, and pork chop are all of above-average quality, and they also come with pretty good fries. Dipping them in the curry sauce is fantastic and makes for a very enjoyable experience. For a theme park, the taste and price are excellent. Plus, there\u0027s air conditioning, making it a highly recommended lunch spot.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "在2F美食街，做餐神速，假日中午人多也是兩分鐘就做好了，白飯、咖哩、蛋包和豬排都有水準以上，還附了蠻好吃的薯條，沾咖哩醬很讚很快樂，以樂園裡來說這個口味和價格很不錯了，還有冷氣吹，值得推薦的中午用餐地點。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
