                        "name":  "places/ChIJCwY8XimvQjQRHq9RBs16-0Y/reviews/Ci9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2pKWk0xcERiblJOWVhWU2VtVllVM0ZrWW1seVdHYxAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "3 months ago",
                        "rating":  1,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The children\u0027s curry was spicy. When I told the staff, they insisted, \"It\u0027s just spices and pepper.\"\n\nMe?! Children\u0027s curry with pepper...\n\nThe two meals were completely different in color and tasted different.\n\nOf the group of children, only the two who ate the curry rice suffered from severe gastroenteritis, vomiting and diarrhea, constantly running to the toilet. Please carefully check the quality of your restaurant.\n\nThe children\u0027s curry being spicy is generally not ideal.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "兒童咖喱的是辣的，跟服務人員反應，堅持說「只是加香料，然後胡椒」\n我？？？兒童咖哩加胡椒⋯\n\n兩份餐，\n色澤完全不同、吃起來也不同\n一群孩子，只有有吃咖喱飯的兩個孩子，嚴重腸胃炎、上吐下瀉，廁所跑不停，請謹慎查看自家品質。\n\n兒童咖喱辣的，本身就不太理想。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
