                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The prices were on the high side, like other restaurants in the park, but the curry, omelette, and rice were all delicious. The fries were also good, though some of them were a bit soggy from the curry. The food was served quickly, and the service was friendly.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "餐點價格和其他樂園內餐廳一樣偏高，但咖哩、歐姆蛋、白飯都是好吃的，薯條也不錯、但部分薯條沾到咖哩變得有點濕軟。出餐速度很快，服務人員態度也好。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
