                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I ordered a fried egg rice and a kids\u0027 meal of popcorn chicken. Not only were the orders slow, but the fries were cold, and the rice grains fell off the plate and bounced. It felt harder than my liver, and the shadows within me darkened the sky.\n\nThere are other better options within the park.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "點了一份炸雞蛋包飯，跟一份雞米花兒童餐，出餐速度慢就算了，薯條是冷的，飯粒掉出盤子外，還會跳起來，感覺比我的肝還硬，內心的陰影讓天都黑了，\n\n園區內還有其他更好的選擇",
